{"version":1,"content":"<p>歐洲國家阿爾巴尼亞首都地拉那近日的反政府示威頻頻演變成暴力衝突，政府周三（28日）宣布，凡參與暴力示威，即使示威者本身並未作出暴力行為，最高亦可被罰款50萬列克（約4.8萬港元）。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:01:42.157186+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:06:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:18:10.598552+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:58:13.490631+00:00","content_hash":"348e77341f3ee75a47947d7dea80f387f7ab937310a4dc09cc0893f54857586f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}